From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 fullscreen events carry the requesting origin (ABI 1.59)

Security audit RC-500 F-08, engine part. Bridge 0.62.0, feature
fullscreen_origin. ReArcEngineSetFullscreenCallback2 delivers
ReArcFullscreenEvent2: the 1.27 event plus the serialized origin of the frame
that called requestFullscreen(), so the host can name the site on every page
fullscreen entry. ReArcFullscreenEvent keeps its layout; setting either
callback replaces the other.

Last rebased: 2026-11-10 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.96 (2ad9b7f5a8).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

